    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.04
  m_Text: "<b><color=#FFBA00>Progress bar (Current maneuver):</color></b> The largest icon represents the section you are driving through right now. As you progress through the corner, this icon fills up.\n<b>How to use it:</b> Watch the fill progress! Once it reaches the end, the corner or hazard is completed, and you can confidently accelerate again."
